---
kind: scene
id: board.hearing
title: The Board of Trade Hearing
when: "@filed"
after: 'visited("rock.report")'
---

## The Hearing Room

::bg{location="board_room" time="day"}
::auto{character="chair" anchor="center" action="fadeInUp"}
@chair{code="0010"}: The inquiry into the loss of Keeper Elias Voss, Skerry Rock light. The inspector's report is before us.
<match on="run.verdictFate">
  <when is="fell">
    @chair{code="0020"}: The inspector finds that Voss fell from the lantern gallery while clearing salt from the glass, the seaward rail having failed.
  </when>
  <when is="murdered">
    @chair{code="0030"}: The inspector alleges foul play. A grave charge. The Board will want to see how it is supported.
  </when>
  <when is="drowned">
    @chair{code="0040"}: The inspector finds that Voss was taken by the sea from the landing.
  </when>
</match>
<match on="run.verdictOnRock">
  <when is="ada">
    @chair{code="0050"}: And that the assistant keeper, Miss Pell, was on the rock against orders, and kept the light burning until dawn.
  </when>
  <when is="tobias">
    @chair{code="0060"}: And that the fisherman Crane came out to the rock that night.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @chair{code="0070"}: And that the keeper was alone on the rock.
  </otherwise>
</match>
